OL,3,GNEWSAMaking a fuss of Black Country
OL,4,Afossils - and why it's important
OL,5,
OL,6,FNestled in the heart of the Black
OL,7,FCountry is an internationally important
OL,8,Fgeological site and a landscape 428
OL,9,Fmillion years in the making.
OL,11,FWren's Nest National Nature Reserve in
OL,12,FDudley is home to millions of fossils
OL,13,Fin its limestone-rich rocks and has
OL,14,Fbeen awarded several accolades to mark
OL,15,Fits significance.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
