OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAMaking a fuss of Black Country
OL,4,Afossils - and why it's important
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of millions of years ago, the
OL,7,Frockface of Wren's Nest was located
OL,8,Funderwater all the way across the
OL,9,Fglobe, south of the equator near what
OL,10,Fis now Brazil. Today, it is one of
OL,11,Fbiggest natural assets of the Black
OL,12,FCountry.
OL,14,FAs Wren's Nest now marks its 70th
OL,15,Fanniversary as a nature reserve, a
OL,16,Fyear-long programme of events and
OL,17,Factivities is being launched to
OL,18,Fcelebrate the site and highlight its
OL,19,Fimportant geology, wildlife, and mining
OL,20,Fheritage.
